      "literal": "$$\n\\min\\limits_{\\boldsymbol{w},\\theta}L(\\boldsymbol{w},\\theta)=\\min\\limits_{\\boldsymbol{w},\\theta}\\sum_{\\boldsymbol{x_i}\\in M}(\\hat{y}_i-y_i)(\\boldsymbol{w}^\\mathrm{T}\\boldsymbol{x}_i-\\theta)\n$$",
