      "literal": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\boldsymbol{w}^\\mathrm{T}\\boldsymbol{x_i}-\\theta&=\\sum\n\\limits_{j=1}^n w_jx_j+x_{n+1}\\cdot w_{n+1}\\\\\n&=\\sum\\limits_{j=1}^{n+1}w_jx_j\\\\\n&=\\boldsymbol{w}^{\\mathrm{T}}\\boldsymbol{x_i}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
