    {
      "exact_item_ids": [],
      "kind": "technical_explanation",
      "meaning_id": "m8",
      "normalized_meaning": "保留[1]李航2012清华大学出版社；[2]全部七位作者、论文名、Neural computation卷期页及1989；[3]三位作者、论文名、nature卷期页及1986。",
